-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 10.10.2011 (הסתדרות המורים) — זכויות הוריות, תוספת
-- מעונות: for the teaching employees in the State's service (§3), to
-- 31.12.2012 (§2), from 1.9.2011 the day-care supplement of §11 of the
-- framework agreement of 12.1.2011 replaces the one paid on the eve of the
-- signing (§4): 300 a month for one child under five, 200 for a second, two
-- at most, in proportion to a position below 100% and as for 100% above
-- it, updated every January by the December CPI, for the periods the
-- teacher is entitled to salary from the employer; an expense
-- reimbursement, not salary; a right connected with parenthood to which
-- §4(א) of the Equal Opportunities Law applies; and it replaces every other
-- arrangement for a child under five. It exhausts §155(א) of the base
-- agreement on the subject (§5), paid from the October 2011 salary, by
-- November's at the latest (§6).
--
-- The terms are the framework agreement's §11 (imported:
-- 2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011), which covers
-- no teaching employee: this agreement brings them to the State's teachers
-- and says where it differs — the share of a part-time or over-full
-- position (§4(ד)), and no general arrangement that survives (§4(ח) has no
-- twin of §11.7). The Equal Opportunities Law is imported too
-- (l4/laws/equal-opportunities-law.l4, MMS-601): a father has the
-- supplement where §4(א) of it says.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT equal_opportunities_law
IMPORT `2011-01-12_framework-agreement_public-sector_tosefet-2011`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — זכויות הוריות, תוספת מעונות (הסתדרות המורים, 10.10.2011)`

DECLARE `day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 action` IS ONE OF
    `ask the teacher for day-care receipts`

