-- akn:preamble/p8 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 Recital: the base agreement of 25.12.08 had the parties negotiate applying to the State's teachers the cost of the framework agreements signed with the Histadrut in its period; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 Recital: the framework agreement of 12.1.2011 was signed; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 Recital: its §11 agreed the day-care supplement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 Recital: the parties agreed how to apply it to the State's teachers; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 Recital: they wish to set it in a collective agreement; no rule.
