-- ¶3: made and signed on 10 October 2011, the day and the month written in
-- by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 10 2011

§§ `1 המבוא והנספחים`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the recitals of 10.10.2011 are part of the agreement` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תקופת ההסכם`

@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
`the day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 runs until` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2012

§§ `3 תחולת ההסכם`

-- Every employee graded in the teaching scale in the State's service
-- ("עובדי הוראה").
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN `in the teaching scale` IS A BOOLEAN, `employed in the State's service` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 applies to` `in the teaching scale` `employed in the State's service` IF
    `in the teaching scale` AND `employed in the State's service`

§§ `4 זכויות הוריות – תוספת מעונות`

-- ¶1: from 1.9.2011, in place of the day-care supplement paid on the eve
-- of the signing, the reimbursement §11 of the framework agreement sets is
-- paid, as follows. Its day is §11's.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
`the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 starts on` MEANS `the 2011 framework day-care supplement starts on`

-- (א): for a partial share in the cost of day care or other supervision,
-- by the conditions below (the purpose adds no condition: convention
-- precedence.rationale); ¶2: a "child" has not yet turned five, unless
-- said otherwise. (ב): paid to a teaching employee who is the mother of a
-- child, asked for no receipts. §11.1–11.2's rule, imported.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a/p2 akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN `a teaching employee who is a mother` IS A BOOLEAN, `the child's age in whole years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` `a teaching employee who is a mother` `the child's age in whole years` IF
    `entitled to the 2011 framework day-care supplement for the child` `a teaching employee who is a mother` `the child's age in whole years`

@ref akn:art_4__para_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 action`
DECIDE `no receipts for the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `ask the teacher for day-care receipts`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "agreement of 10.10.2011, section 4(ב): the mother is not asked for receipts"

-- (ג): 300 a month for one child or the first; 200 for a second. (ה): for
-- two children at most at once. §11.3's amounts and rule, imported.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN `children under five` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for` `children under five` IS
    `the 2011 framework day-care supplement for` `children under five`
        `the 2011 framework day-care supplement for one or a first child`
        `the 2011 framework day-care supplement for a second child`

-- (ד): the amounts are for a full position (100%); below it, in proportion
-- to the position; above it, as for a full position. (§11 says nothing of
-- a part-time position; this is the agreement's own.)
@ref akn:art_4__para_d
GIVEN `children under five` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 = a full position
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for` `children under five` `position fraction` IS
    `the full-position day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for` `children under five` TIMES min `position fraction` 1

-- (ו): from January 2012 the amounts are updated once a year, with the
-- January salary, by the change of the consumer price index between
-- December of the year before the update and December of the year before
-- the previous update (for the first, December 2010). §11.4's rule,
-- imported (convention dates.update-in-force; rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_4__para_f akn:art_4__para_f/p2 akn:art_4__para_f/p3 akn:art_4__para_f/p4 akn:art_4__para_f/p5
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the December indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc from December 2010 to the December before the last January update, in order
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a day-care amount of 10.10.2011 updated each January` amount `the December indices` IS
    `a 2011 framework day-care amount updated each January` amount `the December indices`

-- akn:art_4__para_f/p6 A fax banner; no rule.

-- (ז)(1): paid only for a period the teacher is entitled to salary from the
-- employer, funded by it — not, for instance, for maternity pay under the
-- National Insurance Law, nor for unpaid leave. §11.5.1's rule, imported.
-- (2): an expense reimbursement, so not salary for any purpose; the
-- contributions customary for an expense reimbursement are made on it.
@ref akn:art_4__para_g akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_2
GIVEN `entitled to salary from the employer, funded by it, for the period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 pays for the period` `entitled to salary from the employer, funded by it, for the period` IF
    `the 2011 framework pays day care for the time` `entitled to salary from the employer, funded by it, for the period`

`the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 is salary` MEANS FALSE
`the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 carries an expense reimbursement's contributions` MEANS TRUE

-- (ז)(3): a "right connected with parenthood" under §4(ב) of the Equal
-- Opportunities Law — §4(ב)(4)'s, the employer's share in the cost of day
-- care — and §4(א) applies to it: a father has it where a mother would, a
-- child under five, and his spouse works and does not take it, or the child
-- is in his sole custody.
@ref akn:art_4__para_g__subpara_3
`the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 is a right connected with parenthood` MEANS
    `the employer's share in the cost of keeping the child in day care`

GIVEN f IS A `a father's family under section 4`, `the child's age in whole years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a father entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` f `the child's age in whole years` IF
    `section 4 gives the father the right`
        (`a mother entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` TRUE `the child's age in whole years`)
        f

-- The floor (MMS-601): (ז)(3) gives a father exactly what §4(א) gives him,
-- on the mother's own conditions and no other.
`section 4(ז)(3) of 10.10.2011 gives a father what section 4 of the Equal Opportunities Law gives` MEANS
        `a father entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` `a father whose spouse works and does not take the right` 2
    AND `a father entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` `a father with the child in his sole custody` 2
    AND NOT `a father entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` `a father whose spouse takes the right herself` 2
    AND NOT `a father entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` `a father whose spouse does not work` 2
    AND NOT `a father entitled to the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 for the child` `a father whose spouse works and does not take the right` 5
#ASSERT `section 4(ז)(3) of 10.10.2011 gives a father what section 4 of the Equal Opportunities Law gives`

-- (ח): from the salary of September 2011 it replaces and cancels every
-- other arrangement for a child under five, whatever its name — a direct
-- reimbursement or another benefit, directly or not, a subsidy or a
-- discount on day care among them. (Unlike §11.7, no general arrangement
-- that pays more survives it.)
@ref akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN `the child's age in whole years` IS A NUMBER, `the salary month` IS A DATE @desc the first day of the month whose salary it is
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 cancels another arrangement for the child` `the child's age in whole years` `the salary month` IF
        `the child's age in whole years` LESS THAN `the age a child of the 2011 framework has not yet reached`
    AND `the salary month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011)

§§ `5 מיצוי תביעות`

-- What it says is the full and final exhaustion of §155(א) of the base
-- agreement as far as applying the day-care supplement of §11 goes.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
`the day-care agreement of 10.10.2011 exhausts section 155(א) on day care` MEANS TRUE

§§ `6 מועדי ביצוע`

-- (א): the payments are made from the October 2011 salary, by November
-- 2011's at the latest; (ב): the arrears are paid with the October 2011
-- salary, by November's at the latest.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b
`the first salary that pays the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011
`the latest salary that pays the day-care supplement of 10.10.2011 and its arrears` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 11 2011

